package android.animation; public class ValueAnimator extends Animator { public interface Update {void run(ValueAnimator a);} public static ValueAnimator last; float first,lastValue,value; Update update; public static ValueAnimator ofFloat(float a,float b){last=new ValueAnimator();last.first=a;last.lastValue=b;return last;} public void addUpdateListener(Update u){update=u;} public Object getAnimatedValue(){return value;} public void fraction(float p){value=first+(lastValue-first)*p;update.run(this);} public void start(){fraction(0);} }
